::notes

Serve with a glass of white wine if desired.
The source specifies around -4°C for the fridge rest; this is retained without correction.
The method does not explicitly say when to transfer the rolled dough into the tins; later steps place it there.
Salt and pepper appear in the method’s yolk-pepper-salt-cheese mixture without amounts or a separate addition step.

